{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43310","headline":"言行相顾 · 孟翺","name":"言行相顾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将使言堪复，常闻行欲先。\n比珪斯不玷，修己直如弦。\n跬步非全进，吹嘘禀自然。\n当令夫子察，无宿仲由贤。\n正遇兴邦际，因怀入署年。\n坐知清监下，相顾有人焉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟翺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}